Given the discussion of the whetstone as a possible new tool for nethack,
I thought I might make a couple of much more amusing suggestions.  A
local variant of Nethack called Death evolved separately from Nethack 1.4
or so, and hasn't kept pace with its parent.  But it does have a few
intriguing ideas ...

New tool: tinderbox

New potion: oil (or kerosene)
  dip to remove sticky curse on weapons, armor, rings or amulets
  dip to repair rust or acid damage to weapons and armor
  use to refuel lamps
  ignite with tinderbox for a Molotov cocktail (booze should work also)

New tool: aerosol can
  spraycan of grease  remove sticky curse, repair rust and acid damage
  spraycan of mace    blasts more than one adjacent space and blinds monster
  spraycan of paint   coats weapons and armor to prevent rust and acid damage
		      (after one acid attack the paint peels off.  An idea
		      not in Death would be silver paint to give reflection.)
  spraycan of DDT     bug spray, for those pesky killer bees
  spraycan of musk    perfume to enhance charisma, charm nymphs, etc.
  
Death has a few more clever ideas but this is probably enough for now.

